---
/**
 * Terms of Use. Added 2026-10-09 because Google's OAuth consent screen requires a public
 * terms-of-service URL before an app can leave "Testing" status, and the site had a privacy
 * policy but no terms.
 *
 * NOT REVIEWED BY COUNSEL. This is standard website terms-of-use language adapted to a
 * licensed mortgage banker; it is not legal advice. Have compliance or counsel review it
 * before launch, particularly the arbitration, liability and governing-law sections.
 */
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../../components/layout/Breadcrumbs.astro";
import LegalDoc from "../../components/asym/LegalDoc.astro";
import { COMPANY } from "../../data/company";
const lastUpdated = "2026-10-09";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use | Cliffco Mortgage Bankers"
  description={`The terms that govern your use of the ${COMPANY.brandName} website, including eligibility, acceptable use, electronic communications, and limitations of liability.`}
>
  <Breadcrumbs trail={[
    { name: "Home", href: "/" },
    { name: "Legal", href: "/legal/" },
    { name: "Terms of Use", href: "/legal/terms/" },
  ]} />

  <LegalDoc title="Terms of Use" updated={lastUpdated}>

    <p class="mt-6">
      These Terms of Use govern your access to and use of this website and any related pages,
      forms, calculators, and tools operated by {COMPANY.legalName} (NMLS #{COMPANY.nmls}),
      doing business as {COMPANY.brandName} (&ldquo;Cliffco,&rdquo; &ldquo;we,&rdquo;
      &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo;). By using this site, you agree to these terms. If
      you do not agree, please do not use the site.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4">
      These terms work alongside our <a href="/legal/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>, which explains
      what information we collect and how we use it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">No offer, commitment, or advice</h2>
    <p>
      Nothing on this site is a commitment to lend or to extend credit, an offer to enter into an
      interest rate lock agreement, or a guarantee of any particular loan term. All loans are
      subject to credit approval, underwriting review, property appraisal, and program
      eligibility. Program terms, availability, and guidelines may change without notice and are
      not available in every state.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      Content on this site, including guides, articles, glossary entries, and calculators, is
      general information only. It is not financial, legal, tax, or accounting advice, and it does
      not account for your individual circumstances. Speak with a licensed loan officer, and with
      your own tax or legal advisor where appropriate, before making a decision.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Calculators and estimates</h2>
    <p>
      Any payment, affordability, closing cost, or income figure produced by a tool on this site
      is an illustrative estimate generated from the values you enter. Estimates do not include
      every cost that may apply to your transaction, do not reflect your actual approved terms,
      and are not quotes. Your actual terms are set in the disclosures you receive after you
      apply.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Eligibility and geographic limits</h2>
    <p>
      This site is intended for use by individuals who are at least 18 years old and located in
      the United States. Cliffco is licensed in the states listed on our
      <a href="/licensing/">State Licensing</a> page and does not solicit or originate loans in
      states where it is not licensed. In Florida, Cliffco, Inc. does business as Clout Mortgage,
      Inc.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Information you provide</h2>
    <p>
      When you submit a form, request a pre-qualification, or otherwise contact us, you agree that
      the information you provide is accurate and complete, and that you are authorized to provide
      it. Do not submit information about another person without their permission. We may verify
      any information you give us through third-party sources as part of evaluating a loan
      request.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      Please do not send sensitive personal information, such as a full Social Security number or
      account numbers, through a web form or unencrypted email. Your loan officer will tell you
      how to transmit those securely.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Electronic communications and consent to contact</h2>
    <p>
      By submitting your contact information, you consent to be contacted by Cliffco by phone,
      email, and text message at the number and address you provide, including through automated
      dialing technology, about your inquiry and about products and services that may interest
      you. Consent is not a condition of obtaining any loan or service. Message and data rates may
      apply, and message frequency varies. You may opt out of text messages at any time by replying
      STOP; see our <a href="/legal/sms-consent/">SMS Consent</a> page for details, and our
      <a href="/legal/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for how to opt out of other communications.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      You also agree that we may provide notices, disclosures, and other communications to you
      electronically, and that electronic signatures and records satisfy any legal requirement
      that such communications be in writing.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>You agree not to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Use the site for any unlawful purpose, or to submit false or fraudulent information.</li>
      <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to any portion of the site, its systems, or any other user's data.</li>
      <li>Interfere with or disrupt the site, including by introducing malware or by overloading our infrastructure.</li>
      <li>Scrape, harvest, or systematically collect data from the site except as permitted by our <code>robots.txt</code>.</li>
      <li>Copy, reproduce, or redistribute site content for commercial purposes without our written permission.</li>
      <li>Use the site to send unsolicited commercial messages, or to impersonate any person or entity.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      The site and its contents, including text, graphics, logos, photographs, and the arrangement
      of them, are owned by Cliffco or its licensors and are protected by United States and
      international copyright and trademark law. The Cliffco name and logo are our trademarks. You
      may view and print pages for your own personal, non-commercial use. All other rights are
      reserved.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Third-party links and services</h2>
    <p>
      This site links to third-party websites and uses third-party services, including loan
      application portals, servicing portals, review platforms, and analytics providers. We do not
      control those sites or services and are not responsible for their content, security, or
      privacy practices. A link is not an endorsement. When you leave our site, the terms and
      privacy policy of the destination apply.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Availability</h2>
    <p>
      We work to keep the site available and accurate, but we do not guarantee that it will be
      uninterrupted, error-free, or current at any given moment. We may change, suspend, or
      discontinue any part of the site at any time without notice.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
    <p>
      The site is provided &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and &ldquo;as available,&rdquo; without warranties
      of any kind, whether express or implied, including implied warranties of merchantability,
      fitness for a particular purpose, title, and non-infringement, to the fullest extent
      permitted by law. Some jurisdictions do not allow the exclusion of certain warranties, so
      some of these exclusions may not apply to you.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, Cliffco and its officers, employees, and agents will
      not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or
      for any loss of profits, data, or goodwill, arising out of or relating to your use of this
      site, even if advised of the possibility of such damages. Some jurisdictions do not allow
      these limitations, so they may not apply to you.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Indemnification</h2>
    <p>
      You agree to indemnify and hold Cliffco harmless from any claim, loss, or demand, including
      reasonable attorneys' fees, arising from your misuse of the site, your violation of these
      terms, or your violation of any law or the rights of a third party.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Equal housing and fair lending</h2>
    <p>
      Cliffco is an Equal Housing Lender. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color,
      religion, national origin, sex, marital status, familial status, disability, age, because
      all or part of your income derives from a public assistance program, or because you have in
      good faith exercised a right under the Consumer Credit Protection Act.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Accessibility</h2>
    <p>
      We are committed to making this site usable by everyone. See our
      <a href="/legal/accessibility/">Accessibility Statement</a> for our current conformance
      target and how to reach us if you encounter a barrier.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Governing law</h2>
    <p>
      These terms are governed by the laws of the State of New York, without regard to its
      conflict-of-law rules. Any dispute arising from these terms or your use of the site will be
      brought in the state or federal courts located in Nassau County, New York, and you consent
      to the jurisdiction of those courts. Nothing here limits any right you have to submit a
      complaint to a regulator, including the complaint procedures described on our
      <a href="/licensing/">State Licensing</a> page and our
      <a href="/legal/texas-complaints/">Texas Consumer Complaint</a> page.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these terms from time to time. The &ldquo;last updated&rdquo; date at the top
      of this page reflects the most recent version. Your continued use of the site after a change
      means you accept the updated terms.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10">Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these terms can go to {COMPANY.legalName}, {COMPANY.hq.street},
      {COMPANY.hq.city}, {COMPANY.hq.region} {COMPANY.hq.postalCode}, or call
      <a href={`tel:${COMPANY.tollFreeE164}`}>{COMPANY.tollFree}</a>. You can verify our licensing
      at any time through <a href={COMPANY.nmlsConsumerAccessUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">NMLS Consumer Access</a>.
    </p>

  </LegalDoc>
</Layout>
